<title>INDONESIA: TABLE-Panin Insurance H1 net soars.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Panin Insurance H1 net soars.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			    (in billion rupiah except per share)</p>
<p>    Net income			25.62	  vs    8.05</p>
<p>    Earnings per share  (rph)    53	    vs     45</p>
<p>    Underwriting revenues	 29.51	  vs    6.17</p>
<p>    Underwriting expenses	 31.02	  vs    2.84</p>
<p>    Investment revenues	   44.26	  vs    6.54</p>
<p>    Operating profit		34.86	  vs    8.54</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  35.31	  vs    8.78</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     85.02	  vs   27.82</p>
<p>NOTE: The consolidated results were unaudited. PT Panin Insurance is a member of the Panin Group.</p>
